            <ArticleTitle>Unicornuate uterus with rudimentary horn.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>149-53</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVES" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To identify the effects of unicornuate uterus with rudimentary horn on reproductive function and analyze the diagnosis and treatment of the condition.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">The study was based in the gynecological unit of a city based Medical Center in Mainland China. Twenty-two cases of this anomaly were selected from a group of 130 cases of uterine abnormalities and were retrospectively analyzed.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">This kind of anomaly can cause hematometra and endometriosis leading to acute abdominal pain, infertility, rupture of pregnant rudimentary horn and obstetrical complications with pregnant semi-uterus.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Rudimentary horn should be removed if detected.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
